{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>亚哈随鲁王向各省征收贡品。</b>那些不属他王权管辖的地方——唯有对他的畏惧临到其上, Likewise, distant sea islands that are far from him also only bear this fear. And Scripture mentions this to make known that he prospered in all his ways, and his might was seen after Mordecai became second to him."], :book "esther", :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :zh-Hans, :chapter 10, :timestamp "2026-07-28T00:01:07.061687129Z", :translated-from :en, :model "glm-5.2"}